  "notes": "Modified cash basis city (governmental funds modified cash, enterprise funds accrual); basis set to cash. Governmental roll-forward uses the fund balances on p5 (1,167,258 -> 1,241,890); cash fields left null (beginning cash not printed; ending fund balance = cash 1,072,637 + CDs 159,994 + county treasurer 9,259 on p4). Governmental lines from Total Governmental Funds column p5; Total column prints only the net transfer (160,894 out; GF +8, Street +277,181, Sales Tax -438,075, CDBG -8); business-type +160,894 (Electric 45,831, Water 48,933, Sewer 66,130). Business-type from proprietary statement p7 Total column; no single total printed, so totals are operating + nonoperating; Other revenue counted in Charges for Services on the Statement of Activities. Proprietary cash flow statement (pp8-9) not recorded (proprietary is GAAP only). Balance sheet: government-wide Statement of Net Position p1 (includes governmental capital assets, so governmental funds balance sheet totals differ), component unit excluded. General Fund detail from the departmental combining schedule p14 (more detailed than the p10 budget schedule, which is not recorded). Proprietary statement lines not added to detail (some funds have their own schedules). Read pages 1-14 of 14"
